OL,3,GNEWSALasers and drones employed in the
OL,4,Abattle against gulls
OL,5,
OL,6,FA local authority fighting a
OL,7,Flong-running war with urban gulls has
OL,8,Fcalled in lasers to try to deal with
OL,9,Fthe situation.
OL,11,FEnvironmental health teams from
OL,12,FDumfries and Galloway Council have been
OL,13,Fusing the beams in a bid to scare off
OL,14,Fthe birds and prevent them from nesting
OL,15,Fon council property.
OL,17,FA drone is also being used to track
OL,18,Fdown gull nests at the earliest stage.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
