OL,3,GNEWSALasers and drones employed in the
OL,4,Abattle against gulls
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe new tactics have been successfully
OL,7,Fused at various council buildings
OL,8,Facross the Nithsdale area, according to
OL,9,Fa report to be tabled at the local area
OL,10,Fcommittee next week.
